{"verse_key": "10:6", "surah": 10, "verse": 6, "text_uthmani": "إِنَّ فِى ٱخْتِلَـٰفِ ٱلَّيْلِ وَٱلنَّهَارِ وَمَا خَلَقَ ٱللَّهُ فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ لَـَٔايَـٰتٍ لِّقَوْمٍ يَتَّقُونَ", "translation": "Indeed, in the alternation of the night and the day and [in] what Allāh has created in the heavens and the earth are signs for a people who fear Allāh.", "verse_from_ms": 134390, "verse_to_ms": 150250, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "إِنَّ", "start_ms": 134390, "end_ms": 135840}, {"i": 1, "text": "فِى", "start_ms": 135840, "end_ms": 136040}, {"i": 2, "text": "ٱخْتِلَـٰفِ", "start_ms": 136040, "end_ms": 137030}, {"i": 3, "text": "ٱلَّيْلِ", "start_ms": 137030, "end_ms": 137820}, {"i": 4, "text": "وَٱلنَّهَارِ", "start_ms": 137820, "end_ms": 139270}, {"i": 5, "text": "وَمَا", "start_ms": 139270, "end_ms": 139850}, {"i": 6, "text": "خَلَقَ", "start_ms": 139850, "end_ms": 140540}, {"i": 7, "text": "ٱللَّهُ", "start_ms": 140540, "end_ms": 141310}, {"i": 8, "text": "فِى", "start_ms": 141310, "end_ms": 141510}, {"i": 9, "text": "ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ", "start_ms": 141510, "end_ms": 142930}, {"i": 10, "text": "وَٱلْأَرْضِ", "start_ms": 142930, "end_ms": 143910}, {"i": 11, "text": "لَـَٔايَـٰتٍ", "start_ms": 143910, "end_ms": 145150}, {"i": 12, "text": "لِّقَوْمٍ", "start_ms": 145150, "end_ms": 146840}, {"i": 13, "text": "يَتَّقُونَ", "start_ms": 146840, "end_ms": 149785}]}